indicada pela PF, e não todos os locais das medidas judiciais.", "en": "The event concerns the gold trade chain; the mapped point represents Poconé, identified by Federal Police as the scheme origin, not every warrant location.", "es": "El evento se refiere a la cadena comercial del oro; el punto representa Poconé, señalado por la Policía Federal como origen del esquema, no todos los lugares de las medidas."}, "primary_crime_type": "ILLEGAL_MINING", "crime_types": ["ILLEGAL_MINING", "OTHER_ENVIRONMENTAL_CRIME"], "operation_name": "Arcanjo", "agencies": ["Polícia Federal"], "occurred_at": "2026-08-28T08:18:00-04:00", "published_at": "2026-08-28T08:18:00-04:00", "added_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "backfill": true, "validation_status": "CONFIRMED", "priority": "HIGH", "location": {"name": "Poconé", "admin1": "Mato Grosso", "country": "Brasil", "lat": -16.256, "lon": -56.622, "precision": "municipality_centroid_approximate"}, "protected_area": {"is_protected_area": false}, "impacts": {"indigenous_or_local_communities": false}, "cross_border": false, "keywords": ["ouro", "lavagem de dinheiro", "Poconé", "17,3 kg"], "sources": [{"publisher": "Polícia Federal", "url": "https://www.gov.br/pf/pt-br/assuntos/noticias/2026/08/pf-reprime-comercializacao-de-ouro-de-origem-ilicita/", "published_at": "2026-08-28T08:18:00-04:00", "source_type": "official"}], "source_media": [], "legal_status_note": "Official enforcement or investigation record; no inference of guilt beyond the cited source."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
