Tierra Indígena Yanomami."}, "case_context": {"pt": "A posição é um centróide aproximado da Terra Indígena Yanomami e não representa o aeródromo clandestino identificado na investigação.", "en": "The position is an approximate centroid of Yanomami Indigenous Land and does not represent the clandestine airstrip identified in the investigation.", "es": "La posición es un centroide aproximado de la Tierra Indígena Yanomami y no representa la pista clandestina identificada en la investigación."}, "primary_crime_type": "ILLEGAL_MINING", "crime_types": ["ILLEGAL_MINING", "PROTECTED_AREA_INVASION"], "operation_name": "Aquila Nera II", "agencies": ["Polícia Federal"], "occurred_at": "2026-08-20T15:31:00-04:00", "published_at": "2026-08-20T15:31:00-04:00", "added_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "backfill": true, "validation_status": "CONFIRMED", "priority": "HIGH", "location": {"name": "Terra Indígena Yanomami", "admin1": "Roraima / Amazonas", "country": "Brasil", "lat": 2.1, "lon": -63.8, "precision": "indigenous_land_centroid_approximate"}, "protected_area": {"is_protected_area": true, "name": "Terra Indígena Yanomami"}, "impacts": {"indigenous_or_local_communities": true}, "cross_border": false, "keywords": ["aeronave", "garimpo", "Yanomami", "pista clandestina"], "sources": [{"publisher": "Polícia Federal", "url": "https://www.gov.br/pf/pt-br/assuntos/noticias/2026/08/pf-deflagra-segunda-fase-da-operacao-aquila-nera-em-roraima", "published_at": "2026-08-20T15:31:00-04:00", "source_type": "official"}], "source_media": [], "legal_status_note": "Official enforcement or investigation record; no inference of guilt beyond the cited source."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
