egal, usurpación de bienes de la Unión y lavado de dinero."}, "case_context": {"pt": "O ponto representa Ji-Paraná, base operacional divulgada pela PF; a fonte não publica a coordenada exata das áreas ambientais investigadas.", "en": "The point represents Ji-Paraná, the operational location published by Federal Police; the source does not publish exact coordinates of the investigated environmental sites.", "es": "El punto representa Ji-Paraná, base operativa divulgada por la Policía Federal; la fuente no publica coordenadas exactas de las áreas ambientales investigadas."}, "primary_crime_type": "MULTIPLE_ENVIRONMENTAL_CRIMES", "crime_types": ["ILLEGAL_DEFORESTATION", "ILLEGAL_MINING", "MULTIPLE_ENVIRONMENTAL_CRIMES"], "operation_name": "Olhos Fechados II", "agencies": ["Polícia Federal"], "occurred_at": "2026-08-04T11:07:00-04:00", "published_at": "2026-08-04T11:07:00-04:00", "added_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "backfill": true, "validation_status": "CONFIRMED", "priority": "HIGH", "location": {"name": "Ji-Paraná (base operacional)", "admin1": "Rondônia", "country": "Brasil", "lat": -10.877, "lon": -61.932, "precision": "operation_city_approximate"}, "protected_area": {"is_protected_area": true}, "impacts": {"indigenous_or_local_communities": true}, "cross_border": false, "keywords": ["desmatamento", "garimpo", "lavagem de dinheiro", "Rondônia"], "sources": [{"publisher": "Polícia Federal", "url": "https://www.gov.br/pf/pt-br/assuntos/noticias/2026/08/pf-deflagra-2a-fase-de-operacao-contra-crimes-ambientais-e-lavagem-de-dinheiro-em-terra-indigena-em-rondonia", "published_at": "2026-08-04T11:07:00-04:00", "source_type": "official"}], "source_media": [], "legal_status_note": "Official enforcement or investigation record; no inference of guilt beyond the cited source."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
