ndônia; a coordenada utilizada é uma referência aproximada do parque, não das frentes individuais.", "en": "The park spans Amazonas and Rondônia; the coordinate is an approximate park reference, not the individual mining fronts.", "es": "El parque abarca Amazonas y Rondônia; la coordenada utilizada es una referencia aproximada del parque, no de los frentes individuales."}, "primary_crime_type": "MULTIPLE_ENVIRONMENTAL_CRIMES", "crime_types": ["ILLEGAL_MINING", "ILLEGAL_LOGGING", "LAND_GRABBING", "PROTECTED_AREA_INVASION", "MULTIPLE_ENVIRONMENTAL_CRIMES"], "operation_name": "Caraíba IV", "agencies": ["Polícia Federal", "ICMBio"], "occurred_at": "2026-08-01T12:00:00-04:00", "published_at": "2026-08-01T14:19:00-04:00", "added_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "backfill": true, "validation_status": "CONFIRMED", "priority": "URGENT", "location": {"name": "Parque Nacional Mapinguari", "admin1": "Amazonas / Rondônia", "country": "Brasil", "lat": -8.752, "lon": -64.643, "precision": "protected_area_centroid_approximate"}, "protected_area": {"is_protected_area": true, "name": "Parque Nacional Mapinguari"}, "impacts": {"indigenous_or_local_communities": false}, "cross_border": false, "keywords": ["Mapinguari", "cassiterita", "ouro", "23 acampamentos"], "sources": [{"publisher": "Polícia Federal", "url": "https://www.gov.br/pf/pt-br/assuntos/noticias/2026/08/pf-e-icmbio-deflagram-operacao-caraiba-iv-no-parque-nacional-mapinguari", "published_at": "2026-08-01T14:19:00-04:00", "source_type": "official"}], "source_media": [], "legal_status_note": "Official enforcement or investigation record; no inference of guilt beyond the cited source."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
