and approximate.", "es": "La fuente ubica la acción en el sudoeste de Pará, en la zona de Novo Progresso/Castelo dos Sonhos. El punto es regional y aproximado."}, "primary_crime_type": "ILLEGAL_MINING", "crime_types": ["ILLEGAL_MINING", "PROTECTED_AREA_INVASION", "ILLEGAL_LOGGING"], "operation_name": "Desintrusão TI Baú", "agencies": ["Polícia Federal", "Ibama", "Força Nacional", "CCPI"], "occurred_at": "2026-07-31T12:00:00-03:00", "published_at": "2026-07-31T17:05:00-03:00", "added_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "backfill": true, "validation_status": "CONFIRMED", "priority": "URGENT", "location": {"name": "Terra Indígena Baú / região de Novo Progresso", "admin1": "Pará", "country": "Brasil", "lat": -7.5, "lon": -55.0, "precision": "regional_approximate"}, "protected_area": {"is_protected_area": true, "name": "Terra Indígena Baú"}, "impacts": {"indigenous_or_local_communities": true}, "cross_border": false, "keywords": ["Baú", "garimpo", "desintrusão", "Curuá", "Curuaés"], "sources": [{"publisher": "Polícia Federal", "url": "https://www.gov.br/pf/pt-br/assuntos/noticias/2026/07/pf-realiza-operacao-de-desintrusao-e-combate-a-garimpo-em-terra-indigena", "published_at": "2026-07-31T17:05:00-03:00", "source_type": "official"}], "source_media": [], "legal_status_note": "Official enforcement or investigation record; no inference of guilt beyond the cited source."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
