erra federal. La coordenada representa el municipio porque no se publicó el sitio exacto."}, "primary_crime_type": "ILLEGAL_MINING", "crime_types": ["ILLEGAL_MINING", "ENVIRONMENTAL_CONTAMINATION"], "operation_name": "Ação PF Jacareacanga", "agencies": ["Polícia Federal"], "occurred_at": "2026-07-24T12:00:00-03:00", "published_at": "2026-07-25T21:04:00-03:00", "added_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T02:05:00+07:00", "backfill": true, "validation_status": "CONFIRMED", "priority": "HIGH", "location": {"name": "Jacareacanga", "admin1": "Pará", "country": "Brasil", "lat": -6.223, "lon": -57.752, "precision": "municipality_centroid_approximate"}, "protected_area": {"is_protected_area": false}, "impacts": {"indigenous_or_local_communities": false}, "cross_border": false, "keywords": ["mercúrio", "ouro", "gleba federal", "Jacareacanga"], "sources": [{"publisher": "Polícia Federal", "url": "https://www.gov.br/pf/pt-br/assuntos/noticias/2026/07/pf-prende-dois-por-garimpo-em-terra-da-uniao", "published_at": "2026-07-25T21:04:00-03:00", "source_type": "official"}], "source_media": [], "legal_status_note": "Official enforcement or investigation record; no inference of guilt beyond the cited source."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
